
🛠️ Upfront Onboarding Fees

• 1st Campus Setup: R5,500 (Paid once upfront)
• Per Extra Campus Setup: R2,500 (Paid once upfront)

📊 Scenario 1: College with One Campus

• Base License Fee: R1,500 per month (or R18,000 per year)
• Included Volume: Up to 10,000 applications per year
• Excess Volume Fee: R1.50 per application (Only kicks in after 10,000 apps)
• Absolute Max Cap: R50,000 per year total ceiling (Your bill completely stops charging here, no matter how many apps you get)
• Infrastructure Cost: R0+ paid directly to Firebase by the college via credit card

📊 Scenario 2: College with Multiple Campuses (e.g., 3 Campuses Total)

• Base License Fee: R1,500 + R500 + R500 = R2,500 per month (or R30,000 per year)
• Included Volume: Up to 10,000 unified applications across all campuses combined per year
• Excess Volume Fee: R1.50 per application (Only kicks in after the combined total passes 10,000 apps)
• Absolute Max Cap: R50,000 + R10,000 + R10,000 = R70,000 per year total ceiling (Your bill completely stops charging here, no matter how many apps you get)
• Infrastructure Cost: R0+ paid directly to Firebase by the college via credit card
